  "zh": "# 今日焦点：中国成功发射低轨卫星互联网25组，美联储时隔三年多再次加息25基点，张一鸣成亚洲首富\n## AI 与科技\n- **中国发射低轨卫星互联网25组**：填补全球宽带空白，提升我国空间基础设施能力。\n- **DeepSeek 提升 KV 缓存压缩技术**：显著降低大模型推理成本，推动边缘设备部署。\n- **英伟达宣布原生 GPU Rust 编程支持**：为开发者提供更安全高效的并行计算路径。\n## 产业与市场\n- **张一鸣成为亚洲首富**：反映字节跳动估值持续攀升，互联网巨头格局生变。\n- **美联储时隔三年多再次加息 25 个基点**：表明通胀压力尚未缓解，全球金融市场将面临波动。\n- **平陆运河预计带动广西经济增长**：作为西向通道，将降低物流成本并促进区域产业协同。\n## 国际视野\n- **特朗普公开反对美联储加息政策**：凸显美国政治与货币政策的博弈，可能影响选举走向。\n- **日本高市内阁全体阁僚递交辞呈**：显示内阁危机加深，日本政局面临重组不确定性。",
  "en": "# Today's highlights: China launches 25 low‑orbit internet satellites, the Fed hikes rates after a three‑year pause, and Zhang Yiming becomes Asia’s richest person.\n## AI & Tech\n- **China launches 25 low‑orbit internet satellites**: fills global broadband gaps and strengthens China’s space infrastructure.\n- **DeepSeek advances KV cache compression technology**: cuts inference costs for large models, enabling broader edge deployment.\n- **Nvidia adds native GPU Rust programming support**: gives developers a safer, high‑performance path for parallel computing.\n## Industry & Market\n- **Zhang Yiming becomes Asia’s richest**: reflects ByteDance’s rising valuation and reshapes the internet‑giant hierarchy.\n- **Fed raises rates 25 bps after three‑year hiatus**: signals persistent inflation pressure, likely to stir global financial markets.\n- **Pinglu Canal expected to boost Guangxi’s economy**: as a westward corridor, it will lower logistics costs and spur regional industry synergy.\n## International Outlook\n- **Trump publicly opposes the Fed’s rate‑hike policy**: highlights the clash between U.S. politics and monetary policy, potentially swaying election dynamics.\n- **Japan’s entire cabinet tenders resignations**: underscores a deepening governmental crisis and raises uncertainty over Japan’s political future."
